                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino buyoofu bwa-Jehova bwakasikila zisi zyoonse zyabamasi ibakeengeelede ba-Juda, aboobo teebakali kulwisya Josafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.8.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 8:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamwi baFilisti bakaletela Josafati zipo, ansiliva zyamutelo. Abalo ba-Arabu bakamuletela imbelele zili zyuulu zili musanu azibili amyanda iili musanu aibili, abagutu bali zyuulu zili musanu azibili amyanda iili musanu aibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josafati wakali kuya kunembo lyoonse mubupati, nkabela wakayaka maanda aakulivuna am inzi yaziyobwedo mucisi ca-Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kajisi imbono zinji muminzi ya-Juda, abasilumamba abaalumi basintaze mu-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngooyu mweelwe wabo munzubo zyabo, Mumusyobo wa-Juda: Adina kali mupati wabasilutwe bazyuulu. Kajisi basilumamba bali zyuulu zili myanda yotatwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awabili kali silutwe Jehohanana, kajisi zyuulu zili myanda yobile amakumi aali musanu aatatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
